## 3. What to Verify

In the JSON response, check the following field to confirm the source
(head) repository of the pull request:

- `"head"` → `"repo"` → `"full_name"` — this identifies the repository and
  branch the pull request was created **from** (your fork/branch)
- `"base"` → `"repo"` → `"full_name"` — this identifies the repository the
  pull request is being merged **into**

The `head.repo.full_name` field is the one that specifically demonstrates
which forked repository the pull request originated from.
